        "sendTo": "={{ $('Extract Candidate Profile').item.json.output.personal_information.email }}",
        "subject": "Congratulations! You've Been Shortlisted for the {{ $('Get Job Details').item.json.title }} Position at Fahad.org",
        "message": "=\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f7fb; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#333333;\">\n\n<div style=\"max-width:650px; margin:30px auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\">\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <div style=\"background:#1565C0; color:#ffffff; padding:30px;\">\n        <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">Congratulations!</h1>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:10px;\">You've been shortlisted for an interview.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Body -->\n    <div style=\"padding:35px;\">\n\n        <p>\n            Dear\n            <strong>\n                {{ $('Extract Candidate Profile').item.json.output.personal_information.first_name }}\n                {{ $('Extract Candidate Profile').item.json.output.personal_information.last_name }}\n            </strong>,\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            Thank you for applying for the\n            <strong>{{ $('Get Job Details').item.json.title }}</strong>\n            position at\n            <strong>fahad.org</strong>.\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            We are pleased to inform you that, after carefully reviewing your application,\n            you have been <strong>shortlisted</strong> for the next stage of our recruitment process.\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            We would be delighted to meet with you to discuss your experience,\n            skills, and how they align with this opportunity.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Interview Card -->\n        <div style=\"background:#f8fbff; border-left:5px solid #1565C0; padding:20px; border-radius:8px; margin:30px 0;\">\n\n            <h2 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#1565C0;\">\n                📅 Interview Details\n            </h2>\n\n            <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Position</strong></td>\n                    <td>{{ $('Get Job Details').item.json.title }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Date</strong></td>\n                    <td>{{ $json.start.dateTime.toDateTime().format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Time</strong></td>\n                    <td>{{ $json.start.dateTime.toDateTime().format('HH:mm') }}</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Duration</strong></td>\n                    <td>1 Hour</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Location</strong></td>\n                    <td>ABCD Block, 23 Avenue</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\"><strong>Meeting Link</strong></td>\n                    <td>\n                        <a href=\"{{ $json.conferenceData.entryPoints[0].uri }}\">\n                            Join Interview\n                        </a>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n\n            </table>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tips -->\n        <div style=\"background:#FFF8E1; border-left:4px solid #FFC107; padding:18px; border-radius:6px;\">\n\n            <strong>Please Note:</strong>\n\n            <ul>\n                <li>Join the meeting 5–10 minutes before the scheduled time.</li>\n                <li>Ensure your internet connection, microphone, and camera are working properly.</li>\n                <li>Keep a copy of your resume available during the interview.</li>\n                <li>Prepare any questions you may have about the role or the company.</li>\n            </ul>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <p style=\"margin-top:30px;\">\n            If you have any questions or require an alternative interview time,\n            please reply to this email and we'll be happy to assist you.\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            We appreciate your interest in joining our team and look forward to speaking with you.\n        </p>\n\n        <br>\n\n        <p>\n            Kind regards,\n        </p>\n\n        <strong>John Smith</strong><br>\n        Account Sales Executive / Recruitment Team<br>\n        fahad.org<br>\n        📧 recruitment@fahad.org.com<br>\n        🌐 fahad.org\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <div style=\"background:#f5f7fa; padding:20px; text-align:center; font-size:13px; color:#666666;\">\n        <br><br>\n\n        Please do not reply to this email unless you need assistance regarding your interview.\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n",
